      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this exceptionally bright and spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the Dublin 8 property market. Positioned within the modern and securely gated Davis Court development in Inchicore, No. 16 spans a generous c. 56 sqm and boasts an enviable B BER rating, making it an energy-efficient, low-cost home that also qualifies for highly competitive green mortgage rates. Presenting in turn-key condition, it offers a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or savvy investors looking for a high-yield asset in a prime location.\nThe location is truly second to none. Situated in the heart of historic Inchicore, Davis Court is surrounded by a wealth of local amenities including popular cafes, independent shops, supermarkets, and sports facilities. The vibrant neighborhood is right beside the Grand Canal Greenway and within walking distance of the Phoenix Park, War Memorial Gardens, and St. James's Hospital. Transport links are unbeatable; the Luas Red Line is just a short stroll away, accompanied by frequent bus routes right outside, providing rapid access into Dublin City Centre, Heuston Station, and the M50 motorway network.\nBright internal living accommodation of c. 56 sqm is efficiently laid out and flooded with natural light. The centerpiece of the home is a wonderfully bright open-plan kitchen and living room space, which opens directly onto a private south-facing balcony that captures maximum sunlight throughout the entire day. The property features two generous double bedrooms both with built-in wardrobes, including a master bedroom with its own private ensuite, as well as a sleek main family bathroom. A major bonus for this Dublin 8 property is the inclusion of a secure designated parking space.\nViewing is highly advised. \nCall RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing!\nAdditional Features;\n•c. 56 sqm\n•BER B \n•2 BED / 2 BATH\n•Private south-facing balcony offering maximum natural light\n•Secure designated car parking space included\n•Master bedroom complete with private ensuite\n•Two generous double bedrooms with fitted built-in wardrobes\n•Modern, sleek main family bathroom suite\n•Large open-plan kitchen and living area\n•Secure gated development in the heart of Inchicore\n•Walking distance to Luas Red Line & major bus corridors\n•Close to Phoenix Park, Grand Canal Greenway & St. James's Hospital\n•Ideal for First-Time Buyers, Professionals, and Investors\nDirections: D08 H9H2\n"
      },
      {
